{
  "repo": "EH3D-NODE-BUNGARD-HMI",
  "ecosystem": "eh3d",
  "tagline": "A touch screen with an ESP32-P4 that controls a Bungard CCD machine on its own.",
  "description": "EH3D-NODE-BUNGARD-HMI is firmware in C++17 for the ESP32-P4 module with a 10.1-inch touch display, written for ESP-IDF 5.5 and LVGL 9. Every move and spindle order, from a touch or from the voice, passes the gate: a confirmation on the screen, the hardware-stop latch and the armed link. The rules, the settings file, the spoken orders and the texts in eight languages are tested on a computer; the firmware has not been built or run on a module.",
